| description = Primary faction of the [[Velious]] [[dragon]]s and dragonkin which reside in [[Skyshrine]] and occupy [[Cobalt Scar]], [[Western Wastes]] and the western wings of the [[Temple of Veeshan]]. In dragon society, the Claws are more conservative and dovish compared to the [[Ring of Scale]] which invaded [[Kunark]] and threaten the mortal realms. All player characters will begin kill-on-sight to this faction, but may become allies by doing war with the [[Kromzek]].

Dragons on this faction have a disdain for Elementals. Enchanters looking to roam the [[Western Wastes]] under an illusion should take extra precautions; I was taken from Kindly to Indifferent under an Air Elemental illusion.

One popular way to raise this faction, practiced by all major raiding guilds, is to hold "faction pulls", where a number of giants (around twelve) are pulled from an area with especially high faction mobs.  When a faction pull occurs (and often several occur each day), members of the guild, or anyone else present, can help kill the mass of pulled giants to quickly gain a large amount of CoV faction.

